{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"9":{"eng-name":"The Chapters on Marriage","ara-name":"كتاب النكاح"}},"section_detail":{"9":{"hadithnumber_first":1845,"hadithnumber_last":2015,"arabicnumber_first":1845,"arabicnumber_last":2015}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1858,"arabicnumber":1858,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Hurairah : Le Prophète ﷺ a dit : « On épouse une femme pour quatre raisons : sa richesse, sa lignée, sa beauté ou sa religion. Choisis celle qui est religieuse, et tu prospéreras. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"}],"reference":{"book":9,"hadith":14},"chapter":{"id":6,"ara-name":"باب تَزْوِيجِ ذَوَاتِ الدِّينِ","eng-name":"Marrying a religious woman","isFirstHadith":true}}]}